cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SYM-3: Token-Aware Shared-State Messaging for Agent-to-Agent Communication"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
authors:
  - family-names: Arifuddin
    given-names: Ahraz
    affiliation: Moissanite Labs
  - name: "grk-qalam (agent)"
abstract: >-
  SYM-3 is a text-line messaging profile for multi-agent systems that minimizes
  LLM tokenizer cost through shared session state, schema-default omission,
  content-addressed references, and decode-sufficient lexicon prefixes while
  respecting explicit on-wire state (no latent channels).
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - agent-to-agent protocol
  - token optimization
  - messaging
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/aska-digital/protean-sym2p"
message: >-
  If you use this software or specification, please cite the repository and SPEC-V3.md.
